Dear Quinta=2C

We hope this message finds you well. We=E2=80=99re delighted to share some=
 exciting news from the Marasa Africa team.

We=E2=80=99re pleased to announce the appointment of Lina Nel as Group Hea=
d of Sales & Marketing.

Lina brings over 27 years of award-winning experience in tourism and hospi=
tality sales=2C with a career that spans hotels and lodges=2C airlines=2C=
 and tour operators. She has held senior roles at respected brands such as=
 Abercrombie & Kent=2C Sun Air=2C Three Cities=2C and Newmark Hotels=2C wh=
ere she served for nearly 12 years as Group and International Sales Direct=
or=2C leading the brand=E2=80=99s global expansion.

Holding a BCom in Entrepreneurship=2C Lina has driven the successful launc=
h=2C repositioning=2C and turnaround of numerous properties=2C and played=
 leading roles in mergers and brand takeovers. She later founded Results D=
riven Hospitality Services=2C a consultancy renowned for delivering measur=
able sales results. Her holistic industry perspective and entrepreneurial=
 approach make her perfectly suited to lead Marasa Africa=E2=80=99s sales=
 and marketing strategy as we enter an exciting new phase of growth.

As we step into this exciting new chapter=2C Lina brings with her a strong=
 belief in the power of building lasting partnerships. She emphasizes that=
 relationships are at the heart of everything we do=2C and she is committe=
d to nurturing these connections with care and purpose.

Over the coming months=2C Lina looks forward to meeting many of you in per=
son=2C as time allows=2C and she extends her heartfelt thanks for your con=
tinued support and trust=E2=80=94it means a great deal.

We are excited about the journey ahead with Lina and confident that=2C tog=
ether=2C we will continue to grow the Marasa Africa Experience.

Please join us in welcoming Lina to the Marasa Africa family. We look forw=
ard to the energy and expertise she brings=2C and to building even stronge=
r partnerships together.

Warm regards=2C

